> ... how to change our DEC Alpha (3.2c UNIX) over to 10 Base-T from Coax

Depending on the hardware you have (this will work on the AlphaStations I
have seen), shut down to the SRM console, and at the >>> prompt type

set ewa0_mode twisted

(You can use a bad value, e.g. 'set ewa0_mode abc' to get a list of allowed
values.)

