support (code) and test changers is essentially the same regardless of
whether the device is used as a sequential- or auto-changer.  To be able to 
continue to offer a broad range of device support (device qualification is
a large portion of our testing budget) and to be competitive in the market,
we felt charging for this functionality was warranted.

