Configuration:

Digital Unix 3.2D running on an Alpha 2100 5/300 Dual CPU

TCP/IP network connection to a Remote NetPrint 1000 interface to connect
an HP LaserJet 4m Printer.  

Printer responds to other LPR/LP requests in portrait mode.  The goal is
to 
get output in LANDSCAPE mode.

The following has been put into /etc/printcap:

lp10|10|147.153.113.66|LJ4m:\
        :lf=/usr/spool/lp10err:\
        :lp=:\
        :rm=147.153.113.66:\
        :rp=PORT1:\
