Subject: Re: HELP! What to do with defunct processes? And uninterruptable Comsat?
Date: 1996/10/30
Message-ID: <x74tjcqeda.fsf@hexadecimal.uoregon.edu>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 193277137
references: <Pine.OSF.3.95.961030174250.7333A-100000@griffo.mat.unimi.it>
organization: University of Oregon
