packages associated with DECnet.  I am able to use dlogin to access
remote DECnet hosts.  The dnet_check seems happy.  But when I try
to send mail, success is not so forthcoming.

I used mailconfig to set up the machine as a server that understands
the DECnet Phase IV protocol.  We have many machines here on
campus that speak and send mail via Phase IV.  A typical session
looks like so:

# Mail -v wunet::noc
Subject: Hello
This is a test...
.
EOT
wunet::noc... Connecting to wunet via mail11_IV...
220 Mail-11_V3.0 DECnet/OSI Mail-11 Mailer
>>> HELO oldarchive.wustl.edu
