processes but after the 64th process, it denied to fork and return
an error :
(I am sure I have enough memory to handle it : 512Mb, each 
of the httpd will only take up 300-500Kb)

Sep 30 10:38:03 SILICON vmunix: fork/procdup: task_create failed. Code:
0x11
Sep 30 10:38:03 SILICON last message repeated 15 times
Sep 30 10:41:37 SILICON vmunix: fork/procdup: task_create failed. Code:
0x11                                                                    

	How do I test it out whether it's the OS problem or the
Netscape Commerce Server problem ?


