Hmm. When I compiled mtools for Alphastations, I only had to tweak the
config file, /etc/mtools.conf
Here's mine:
--
drive a: file="/dev/fd0c"
        fat_bits=12
        tracks=80 heads=2 sectors=18
        nodelay
--
And the device file, /dev/fd0c, has to be accessible to people other
than root if you want them to able to use it.

