NQM - Network Queue Management, is a comprehensive package for output
management, spooling and accounting in a mixed network environment.
NQM supports bi-directional filtering and printing (any file-type) to
devices like:
	HP-LaserJet using PJL, Direct TCP
	QMS Crown using DOC, Direct TCP and TTY
	Any TTY device
