	VAX & AXP / VMS
	The above Unix platforms

NQM is based on one central broker, distributed print servers and
distributed clients. NQM operates using advanced RPC techniques that
allows a single job to be routed (for rendering etc) across different
CPU's before terminating (typically printing). The configuration is
done centrally through a Motif GUI.

