Thanks to all of You, who emailed, phoned, or faxed me. Here is a
sample answer, which fixes the problem

in File: /etc/zoneinfo/sources/europe

replace:

Rule    M-Eur   1979    max    -       Sep     lastSun  2:00s  0       -

by:
Rule    M-Eur   1979    1995    -       Sep     lastSun  2:00s  0       -
Rule    M-Eur   1996    max     -       Oct     lastSun  2:00s  0       -

then compile with:

zic /etc/zoneinfo/sources/europe

and reboot

For OSF1 3.2 C (or higher) there is a patch at DECs www-server

Manfred



