In sendmail.cf either write:

Cw dom1.com, dom2.com

or:

Fw/etc/sendmail.cw

and in the file "/etc/sendmail.cw" write:
dom1.com
dom2.com

Then change your DNS files in "/etc/namedb".

1) in "named.boot" write

primary	dom1.com	hosts.dom1.com
primary	dom2.com	hosts.dom2.com

2) in hosts.dom1.com after the SOA record

dom1.com.       IN MX 10    your.dnd.com.

3) in hosts.dom2.com after the SOA record

dom2.com.       IN MX 10    your.dnd.com.

I think that's all.
Ciao,

